invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_avx2.c
catches: rsa_avx2_model_test
reason: the triangle gives row 3 of every group a y, where the last group's
  rows from the digit count n up must take none: their lanes hold the
  result's low digits. At RSA-2048 n is 74, so the last group's row 75
  adds y times m above the result's digit 0 and the number passes 2m.
  bin/rsa_avx2_model_test requires every product below 2m and equal to
  rsa_mont64.c's less m.

--- old
    uint64_t step3 = rows > 3 ? mask : 0;
--- new
    uint64_t step3 = mask;
